+## Development Workflow
 
-[SECTION_3_CONTENT]
-<!-- Example: Code review requirements, testing gates, deployment approval process, etc. -->
+- Each request is a fresh session: record decisions in the Spec Kit artifacts under `specs/` and in code,
+  tests and README, not in memory.
+- Specs MUST state the affected README rules and the boundary cases. Plans MUST include a constitution check
+  against the principles above. Tasks put tests before implementation.
+- Before finishing: run `npm test`, confirm the README rules still hold, and confirm no unrelated files changed.
 
